<h1 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white tracking-tight">Notifications & Alerts</h1>
<p class="text-sm font-normal text-[#8A8A93] leading-relaxed mt-3 mb-10">
    When a monitor enters the LATE or FAILED state, HealthyCron routes the alert to all configured integration channels linked to that specific monitor.
</p>

<h2 class="text-base font-medium text-white mb-4 mt-8">Alert Deduplication</h2>
<p class="text-sm font-normal text-[#8A8A93] leading-relaxed mb-4">
    You will only receive one alert per failure incident. HealthyCron will not spam your channels on every missed check interval.
</p>
<p class="text-sm font-normal text-[#8A8A93] leading-relaxed mb-4">
    Once a failed job sends a successful ping again, its state returns to Healthy, and a <strong>recovery notification</strong> is dispatched.
</p>

<h2 class="text-base font-medium text-white mb-6 mt-12">Available Channels</h2>

<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-12">
    <!-- Email -->
    <div class="bg-hc-black-light border border-white/5 rounded-2xl p-5 hover:border-white/10 transition-colors">
        <div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-4">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <i data-lucide="mail" class="w-5 h-5 text-hc-muted"></i>
                <h3 class="font-semibold text-white text-sm">Email</h3>
            </div>
            <span class="text-[9px] font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-emerald-400 bg-emerald-400/10 border border-emerald-400/20 rounded px-1.5 py-0.5">Available</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-[#8A8A93] leading-relaxed">
            Setup via your account settings. Receives an HTML-formatted alert containing the job name, the last seen ping time, and the expected schedule configuration.
        </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Webhooks -->
    <div class="bg-hc-black-light border border-white/5 rounded-2xl p-5 hover:border-white/10 transition-colors">
        <div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-4">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <i data-lucide="webhook" class="w-5 h-5 text-hc-muted"></i>
                <h3 class="font-semibold text-white text-sm">Webhooks</h3>
            </div>
            <span class="text-[9px] font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-emerald-400 bg-emerald-400/10 border border-emerald-400/20 rounded px-1.5 py-0.5">Available</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-[#8A8A93] leading-relaxed">
            Sends a standard HTTP POST request to your designated URL with a JSON body describing the event state.
        </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Telegram -->
    <div class="bg-hc-black-light border border-white/5 rounded-2xl p-5 hover:border-white/10 transition-colors">
        <div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-4">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <i data-lucide="send" class="w-5 h-5 text-[#3b82f6]"></i>
                <h3 class="font-semibold text-white text-sm">Telegram</h3>
            </div>
            <span class="text-[9px] font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-emerald-400 bg-emerald-400/10 border border-emerald-400/20 rounded px-1.5 py-0.5">Available</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-[#8A8A93] leading-relaxed">
            Create a bot using BotFather, grab your Chat ID, and paste the webhook URL in your integration settings to receive instant mobile alerts.
        </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Pushover -->
    <div class="bg-hc-black-light border border-white/5 rounded-2xl p-5 hover:border-white/10 transition-colors">
        <div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-4">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <i data-lucide="smartphone-charging" class="w-5 h-5 text-hc-muted"></i>
                <h3 class="font-semibold text-white text-sm">Pushover</h3>
            </div>
            <span class="text-[9px] font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-emerald-400 bg-emerald-400/10 border border-emerald-400/20 rounded px-1.5 py-0.5">Available</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-[#8A8A93] leading-relaxed">
            High-priority push notifications directly to iOS/Android devices, supporting custom priority levels and custom notification sounds.
        </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Slack -->
    <div class="bg-hc-black-light border border-white/5 rounded-2xl p-5 opacity-70">
        <div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-4">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <i data-lucide="slack" class="w-5 h-5 text-hc-muted"></i>
                <h3 class="font-semibold text-white text-sm">Slack</h3>
            </div>
            <span class="text-[9px] font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-[#8A8A93] bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded px-1.5 py-0.5">Coming Soon</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-[#8A8A93] leading-relaxed">
            Rich message blocks sent directly to a designated channel via an incoming webhook.
        </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Discord -->
    <div class="bg-hc-black-light border border-white/5 rounded-2xl p-5 opacity-70">
        <div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-4">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <i data-lucide="message-square" class="w-5 h-5 text-hc-muted"></i>
                <h3 class="font-semibold text-white text-sm">Discord</h3>
            </div>
            <span class="text-[9px] font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-[#8A8A93] bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded px-1.5 py-0.5">Coming Soon</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-[#8A8A93] leading-relaxed">
            Delivers embed alerts to any text channel via a Discord integration webhook URL.
        </p>
    </div>

    <!-- PagerDuty -->
    <div class="bg-hc-black-light border border-white/5 rounded-2xl p-5 opacity-70">
        <div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-4">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <i data-lucide="phone-call" class="w-5 h-5 text-[#22C55E]"></i>
